        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our enclosed multi‑axle trailers feature hydraulic ramp loading, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Combined with our 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, each bike is secured against vibration and contact, ensuring a zero‑scratch guarantee throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors determine the cost of bike transport from Bangalore to Udupi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges are based on distance (approximately 850 km), bike size, required packaging, insurance coverage, and any special handling like disassembly. Private packers and movers may offer tailored rates, and our instant quote tool provides a transparent breakdown before you book.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance coverage truly 100% for my bike’s declared value?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We provide IRDAI‑approved, 100% insured coverage for the full declared value of your bike. In the unlikely event of damage, the claim process is swift, and you receive the exact amount of the insured value without depreciation deductions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s location in real time during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each shipment is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live updates to our portal and mobile app. You receive real‑time alerts at key milestones—pickup, en‑route checkpoints, and delivery—so you always know where your bike is.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide GST‑compliant invoices for corporate or PSU relocations?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All our invoices are GST‑compliant, include detailed service breakdowns, and are accepted for reimbursement by central and state government departments, PSUs, and corporate entities. This simplifies claim filing for businesses moving bikes between Bangalore and Udupi.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transport take from Bangalore to Udupi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We guarantee a 1‑2 day delivery window for standard bike parcels, leveraging the National Highway Arterial Corridors and our dedicated express freight lanes. Exact timing depends on traffic and weather, but we keep you informed throughout.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What preparation is required from my side before the bike is picked up?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We recommend cleaning the bike, removing loose accessories, and noting any pre‑existing scratches. Our team will handle fuel drainage, battery disconnect, and secure packaging. Providing these details helps us ensure a smooth, damage‑free loading process.</p>
      </div>
